+# fiscal start month in the year typed, yyyy; a fiscal year is named by the calendar year its first day falls in),
+# made exactly as generate-periods makes them: each from the month's first to its last day, named yyyy-mm; a month
+# whose name is already a period on the sheet, or whose days overlap one, is left out and the others are still made,
+# each audited as PERIOD_ADDED. A year that is not four digits is refused (400). Answers how many were made.
